<title>USA: Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude oil for end-May.</title>
<headline>Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude oil for end-May.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's state oil company Empresa Nacional del Petroleo (ENAP) is seeking to buy 960,000 barrels of crude oil for delivery at the end of May to early June, trade sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender will be awarded on April 17.</p>
<p>In its last purchase tender, ENAP bought 360,000 barrels of Ecuadoran Oriente crude for delivery around May 20.</p>
<p>Separately, Colombia's state oil company Ecopetrol is receiving bids today to sell a cargo of Cano Limon crude for loading at the end of May, trade sources said.</p>
<p>--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
